#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kioslave mailto is responsible for launching the mail composer of your "
"choice when you open a &URL; in the mailto scheme (<ulink url=\"http://tools."
"ietf.org/html/rfc6068\">RFC6068</ulink>)."
msgstr ""
"O kioslave mailto inicia o editor de correo preferido polo usuario cando "
"este abre un &URL; co esquema mailto (<ulink url=\"http://tools.ietf.org/"
"html/rfc6068\">RFC6068</ulink>)."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "Sintaxe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "The syntax of a mailto &URL; follows the following pattern:"
msgstr "A sintaxe dun &URL; mailto segue o seguinte padrón:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "mailto:recipients?query"
msgstr "mailto:destinatarios?query"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"where recipients form a list of restricted &SMTP; address specifications, "
"and the query part may contain one or more of the following parameters:"
msgstr ""
"onde destinatarios forma unha lista de especificacións de enderezos &SMTP; "
"restrinxida, e a parte query pode conter un ou máis dos seguintes parámetros:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;to=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;to=destinatarios"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies additional recipients."
msgstr "Especifica destinatarios adicionais."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;cc=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;cc=destinatarios"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies additional recipients of carbon copies."
msgstr "Indica destinatarios adicionais de copias."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;bcc=recipients"
msgstr "&amp;bcc=destinatarios"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies additional recipients of blind carbon copies. These recipients "
"will receive the message, but all other recipients will not know about that."
msgstr ""
"Indica destinatarios adicionais de copias agochadas. Estes han recibir a "
"mensaxe, pero os demais destinatarios non o han saber."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;body=text"
msgstr "&amp;body=texto"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specifies the text of the message. This text should not be long, as there "
"may be hard limits on how long an &URL; may be."
msgstr ""
"Especifica o texto da mensaxe. Non debe ser longo xa que poden haber "
"limitacións na lonxitude do &URL;."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "&amp;subject=text"
msgstr "&amp;subject=texto"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specifies the subject of the message."
msgstr "Indica o asunto da mensaxe."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Exemplo"

#. Tag: literal
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"mailto:info@kde.org?cc=kde@kde.org&amp;subject=Thank%20you!&amp;body=KDE"
"%20rocks!%20How%20can%20I%20help%3F"
msgstr ""
"mailto:info@kde.org?cc=kde@kde.org&amp;subject=Moitas%20grazas!&amp;body=KDE"
"%20mola!%20Como%20poido%20axudar%3F"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the application to handle mailto locators in &systemsettings; "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Workspace Appearance and Behaviour</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Default Applications</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Pode escoller o aplicativo co que manexar os localizadores mailto en "
"&systemsettings; <menuchoice><guimenu>Aparencia e comportamento da área de "
"traballo</guimenu><guimenuitem>Aplicativos predeterminados</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#~ msgid "&Ferdinand.Gassauer; &Ferdinand.Gassauer.mail;"
#~ msgstr "&Ferdinand.Gassauer; &Ferdinand.Gassauer.mail;"

